1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,965
Day 2 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,375
11 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:06,225
…and you have
big plans!

4
00:00:06,565 --> 00:00:09,356
Yesterday: 57 residents.

5
00:00:09,356 --> 00:00:10,904
Today? 71!

6
00:00:11,244 --> 00:00:15,033
That brings
€14,033 into the budget!

7
00:00:15,373 --> 00:00:17,857
Joe asked for
a plane as a house…

8
00:00:17,857 --> 00:00:19,496
Cleared for landing!

9
00:00:19,836 --> 00:00:22,290
Iknowlightyagamiiskira asked for
a big house…

10
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,464
Here it is!

11
00:00:23,804 --> 00:00:28,170
Not14redmi and 11 more
move into the apartment block!

12
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:31,068
Erik and Alex
both want to be principal!

13
00:00:31,068 --> 00:00:34,079
Erik even has a title:
Principal Banana!

14
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:36,294
Whoever asked first
gets the job!

15
00:00:36,634 --> 00:00:39,599
Iknowlightyagamiiskira wants to be president…

16
00:00:39,599 --> 00:00:41,810
…and Divish wants to be
the government!

17
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:43,623
So we hold an
election!

18
00:00:43,963 --> 00:00:45,523
Dollars, Ari?

19
00:00:45,523 --> 00:00:48,186
Sorry, Leoville pays
in euros!

20
00:00:48,526 --> 00:00:50,068
And what do you
want next?

21
00:00:50,068 --> 00:00:51,895
The school is in the lead!

22
00:00:52,235 --> 00:00:55,535
The school costs
€120,000.

23
00:00:55,535 --> 00:00:58,117
Ecaterina's sister
is waiting for it!

24
00:00:58,117 --> 00:01:00,594
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

25
00:01:00,934 --> 00:01:02,595
Who should lead
Leoville?

26
00:01:02,595 --> 00:01:04,375
Vote in the
comments!
